---
import ClientCaseStudyPage from "../../components/ClientCaseStudyPage.astro";
import CaseStudyImageSlot from "../../components/CaseStudyImageSlot.astro";
import { clientCaseStudyMedia } from "../../data/clientCaseStudyMedia";
const media = clientCaseStudyMedia.perfectClean;
---
<ClientCaseStudyPage
  previewOnly={true}
  client="Perfect Clean"
  title="Perfect Clean: Show the Work, Hear From the Owner"
  metaTitle="Perfect Clean Video Advertising Case Study | NextVision"
  description="Video advertising creative for Perfect Clean, combining the cleaning work process with the owner's explanation and a customer-focused message."
  intro="Advertising creative built around the work process, the owner speaking and personal attention to the customer."
  service="Owner-led video and advertising creative"
  hero={media.hero}
  serviceHref="/short-form-video-production-dublin/"
  serviceLabel="Explore advertising video production"
>
  <section id="the-project">
    <h2>A person behind the service</h2>
    <p>For Perfect Clean, I filmed the work process and the owner speaking about the business. The videos were used as advertising creative.</p>
    <p>The message centred on how the company treats its customers: each person should receive attention and feel that their needs have been understood. The owner gave that message a direct voice.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="the-creative">
    <h2>The owner and the work in the same story</h2>
    <p>The owner speaks directly to camera in an office setting. The finished ads pair that explanation with supporting scenes and captions, keeping his message at the centre of the creative.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="client-image-pair">
    <CaseStudyImageSlot image={media.detail} assetKey="perfectClean:detail" />
    <CaseStudyImageSlot image={media.work} assetKey="perfectClean:work" />
  </div>

  <section id="advertising-use">
    <h2>Made for advertising</h2>
    <p>The videos were used to introduce Perfect Clean through paid creative. The production brief focused on the message, the owner and the work that could support the explanation.</p>
    <p>For a similar project, <a href="/short-form-video-production-dublin/">short-form video production</a> defines the filming and finished edits. <a href="/google-ads-meta-ads-dublin/">Campaign management</a> covers how advertising is run. The two scopes can be planned together around a clear audience and next step.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="planning-a-similar-shoot">
    <h2>Start with what your customer needs to hear</h2>
    <p>Choose the question, who will answer it and which part of the work helps explain the answer. In this project, those choices connected the owner, the cleaning process and personal customer attention.</p>
    <p>The <a href="/blog/customer-questions-into-business-videos/">customer-question guide</a> helps turn that starting point into a brief. For a more detailed introduction, explore <a href="/corporate-video-production-dublin/">an owner-led business film</a>.</p>
  </section>
</ClientCaseStudyPage>
